1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,993
Mimzi has a new red ball.

2
00:00:03,543 --> 00:00:05,465
Look at my bouncy ball!

3
00:00:05,465 --> 00:00:06,648
Boing, boing!

4
00:00:07,998 --> 00:00:10,861
Can I play with the ball too, Mimzi?

5
00:00:11,411 --> 00:00:13,386
No! It's mine!

6
00:00:13,936 --> 00:00:14,732
Oh no.

7
00:00:14,732 --> 00:00:16,413
Teddy feels sad.

8
00:00:18,213 --> 00:00:20,088
I just want to play.

9
00:00:20,888 --> 00:00:23,126
How do you think Teddy feels?

10
00:00:25,126 --> 00:00:27,102
Teddy feels sad.

11
00:00:28,452 --> 00:00:30,904
Mimzi thinks for a moment.

12
00:00:31,704 --> 00:00:34,950
Hmm. Playing alone is not much fun.

13
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,161
Teddy, do you want to play with me?

14
00:00:39,511 --> 00:00:40,548
Yes, please!

15
00:00:40,548 --> 00:00:41,931
Thank you, Mimzi!

16
00:00:42,481 --> 00:00:45,385
Mimzi rolls the ball to Teddy.

17
00:00:45,635 --> 00:00:47,493
Roll, roll!

18
00:00:48,043 --> 00:00:50,220
And I roll it back to you!

19
00:00:51,570 --> 00:00:54,534
Taking turns is so much fun!

20
00:00:55,084 --> 00:00:58,012
Now Mimzi and Teddy are both happy.

21
00:01:00,662 --> 00:01:01,728
When we share,

22
00:01:01,728 --> 00:01:03,358
our friends feel happy,

23
00:01:03,358 --> 00:01:04,424
and we do too.

24
00:01:04,974 --> 00:01:07,071
Sharing is caring!

25
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:09,335
Sharing is caring!

26
00:01:10,685 --> 00:01:12,922
Great job, little learner!

27
00:01:13,472 --> 00:01:15,361
Share Mimzi with a friend,

28
00:01:15,361 --> 00:01:17,901
and subscribe for more learning fun!

29
00:01:18,451 --> 00:01:19,480
Next time,

30
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:21,616
watch me brush my teeth.

31
00:01:21,866 --> 00:01:23,237
Bye bye!
